---
name: dev-sanity-complete
version: 2.0.1
description: Selected sanity verdict; FAIL within the round cap sends sanity-fail to the dev and creates no finding bead.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - checked_bead
  - sprint
  - verdict
  - findings_count
  - findings_md
  - lint_md
defaults:
  qa_task_id: ""
  sanity_task_id: ""
  dev_task_id: ""
  pr_number: ""
  commit: ""
  branch: ""
  run_id: "legacy"
  reviewer: "sanity-llm"
  notes_md: ""
  selection: []
metadata:
  type: dev-sanity-complete
  tags:
    - stage:dev-sanity
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint
    state: dev-sanity-complete
    stage: dev-sanity
    transition: complete
---
{% set task_id = sanity_task_id if sanity_task_id else task_id %}
{% if verdict not in ["PASS", "FAIL", "CANNOT_RUN"] %}{{ verdict | verdict_must_be_PASS_or_FAIL }}ERROR: verdict must be PASS, FAIL or CANNOT_RUN, got {{ verdict }}
{% endif %}# Dev Sanity Check {{ verdict }}

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Run: {{ run_id }} · Operational reviewer: {{ reviewer }}
Bead: {{ task_id }} (sprint {{ sprint }})
Checked: {{ checked_bead }} on `{{ branch }}` at `{{ commit }}`
Verdict: **{{ verdict }}** ({{ findings_count }} findings)
{% if verdict == "FAIL" %}
For a FAIL within the configured round cap, the dev was sent `sanity-fail`; a FAIL exceeding the cap triggers lead escalation; no finding beads were filed.
{% endif %}

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "run_id": {{ run_id | tojson }},
  "reviewer": {{ reviewer | tojson }},
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "checked_bead": {{ checked_bead | tojson }},
  "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "verdict": {{ verdict | tojson }},
  "findings": {{ findings_count }},
  "selection": {{ (selection or []) | tojson }}
}
```

## Selection
{% for item in selection or [] %}
- D{{ item.deliverable }}: LLM={{ item.llm }}, JEV={{ item.jev }}, selected={{ item.selected }}{% if item.reason %}; {{ item.reason }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

## Findings
{{ findings_md }}

## Lint
{{ lint_md }}
{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
